{"sha": "82fa8be57159d262bc9f3565c0ea051adfddbe1d2cd87b901fcdea659547731f", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g12:trigo} 章 --- 三角函数}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:trigo:1}", "$\\cos\\frac{2\\pi}{3} = \\cos\\left(\\pi - \\frac\\pi3\\right) = -\\cos\\frac\\pi3", "= -\\frac12$.", "", "$\\sin\\frac{5\\pi}{6} = \\sin\\left(\\pi - \\frac\\pi6\\right) = \\sin\\frac\\pi6", "= \\frac12$.", "", "$\\cos\\frac{7\\pi}{4} = \\cos\\left(2\\pi - \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)", "= \\cos\\left(-\\frac\\pi4\\right) = \\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}$.", "", "$\\sin\\left(-\\frac\\pi3\\right) = -\\sin\\frac\\pi3 = -\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:trigo:2}", "$f'(x) = 2\\sin x\\cos x = \\sin 2x$（链式法则）。", "", "$g'(x) = -3\\sin(3x) + \\sin x + x\\cos x$（链式法则与乘积法则）。", "", "商的求导法则：", "\\[", "h'(x) = \\frac{\\cos x\\,(2 + \\cos x) - \\sin x\\,(-\\sin x)}{(2+\\cos x)^2}", "= \\frac{2\\cos x + \\cos^2 x + \\sin^2 x}{(2+\\cos x)^2}", "= \\frac{2\\cos x + 1}{(2+\\cos x)^2}.", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:trigo:3}", "\\emph{(a)} 方程 $\\sin x = \\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}$ 的一个特解为", "$\\frac\\pi3$。通解为 $x = \\frac\\pi3 + 2k\\pi$ 或", "$x = \\pi - \\frac\\pi3 + 2k\\pi = \\frac{2\\pi}{3} + 2k\\pi$。在", "$\\intoc{-\\pi}{\\pi}$: $x \\in \\left\\{\\frac\\pi3, \\frac{2\\pi}{3}\\right\\}$.", "", "\\emph{(b)} 由 $\\cos 2x = \\frac{\\sqrt2}{2} = \\cos\\frac\\pi4$ 得", "$2x = \\pm\\frac\\pi4 + 2k\\pi$，于是 $x = \\pm\\frac\\pi8 + k\\pi$。在", "$\\intoc{-\\pi}{\\pi}$:", "$x \\in \\left\\{-\\frac{7\\pi}{8}, -\\frac\\pi8, \\frac\\pi8, \\frac{7\\pi}{8}\\right\\}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:trigo:4}", "取 $a = \\frac\\pi3$，$b = \\frac\\pi4$，则：", "\\[", "\\cos\\frac{\\pi}{12} = \\cos a\\cos b + \\sin a \\sin b", "= \\frac12\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2} + \\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}", "= \\frac{\\sqrt2 + \\sqrt6}{4},", "\\]", "\\[", "\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{12} = \\sin a\\cos b - \\cos a \\sin b", "= \\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2} - \\frac12\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}", "= \\frac{\\sqrt6 - \\sqrt2}{4}.", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:trigo:5}", "令 $s = \\sin x$，则 $2s^2 - s - 1 = (2s + 1)(s - 1) \\geq 0$ 当且仅当", "$s \\leq -\\frac12$ 或 $s = 1$。", "", "$\\sin x = 1$ 得 $x = \\frac\\pi2$。当 $\\sin x \\leq -\\frac12$ 时，在单位", "圆上，位于水平直线 $y = -\\frac12$ 下方的弧段，在", "$\\intcc{0}{2\\pi}$ 内即 $x \\in \\intcc{\\frac{7\\pi}{6}}{\\frac{11\\pi}{6}}$。", "因此", "\\[", "S = \\left\\{\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right\\} \\cup", "\\intcc{\\frac{7\\pi}{6}}{\\frac{11\\pi}{6}} .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:trigo:6}", "$\\dfrac{\\sin 3x}{x} = 3\\,\\dfrac{\\sin 3x}{3x} \\to 3 \\cdot 1 = 3$", "（复合函数极限，$u = 3x \\to 0$）。", "", "利用 $1 - \\cos x = \\dfrac{\\sin^2 x}{1 + \\cos x}$：", "\\[", "\\frac{1 - \\cos x}{x^2}", "= \\left(\\frac{\\sin x}{x}\\right)^{\\!2} \\frac{1}{1 + \\cos x}", "\\xrightarrow[x\\to0]{} 1 \\cdot \\frac12 = \\frac12 .", "\\]", "", "令 $u = \\frac1x \\to 0^+$：", "$x \\sin\\frac1x = \\frac{\\sin u}{u} \\to 1$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:trigo:7}", "$f'(x) = 1 - \\sin x \\geq 0$ 对所有 $x$ 成立，等号当且仅当", "$\\sin x = 1$，\\emph{即} $x = \\frac\\pi2 + 2k\\pi$。在 $\\intcc{0}{2\\pi}$ 上，$f$", "递增，从 $f(0) = 1$ 增至 $f(2\\pi) = 2\\pi + 1$（$f'$ 的零点", "$\\frac{\\pi}{2}$ 处孤立，故递增甚至是严格的）；最小值 $1$ 在", "$0$ 处取得，最大值 $2\\pi + 1$ 在 $2\\pi$ 处取得。在 $\\R$ 上，$f' \\geq 0$ 处处成立，且", "零点仅为孤立点，故由", "\\cref{thm:g12:deriv:variations}可知 $f$ 为（严格）递增，虽然 $f'$ 在每个", "$\\frac\\pi2 + 2k\\pi$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:trigo:8}", "\\emph{1.} 设 $R = \\sqrt{A^2 + B^2} > 0$，点", "$\\left(\\frac AR, \\frac BR\\right)$ 位于单位圆上，故存在", "$\\varphi$ 使得 $\\cos\\varphi = \\frac AR$，$\\sin\\varphi = \\frac BR$。于是", "\\[", "R\\cos(x - \\varphi) = R\\bigl(\\cos x\\cos\\varphi + \\sin x \\sin\\varphi\\bigr)", "= A\\cos x + B\\sin x = f(x).", "\\]", "", "\\emph{2.} 由于 $\\cos$ 的值域为 $\\intcc{-1}{1}$，故 $f$ 的最大值为 $R$，且", "最小值为 $-R$。对于 $\\cos x + \\sin x$，$A = B = 1$，$R = \\sqrt2$，", "$\\varphi = \\frac\\pi4$，故方程化为", "$\\sqrt2\\cos\\left(x - \\frac\\pi4\\right) = 1$，\\emph{即}", "$\\cos\\left(x - \\frac\\pi4\\right) = \\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}$，得", "$x - \\frac\\pi4 = \\pm\\frac\\pi4 + 2k\\pi$。在 $\\intoc{-\\pi}{\\pi}$ 内，", "$x \\in \\left\\{0, \\frac\\pi2\\right\\}$.", "\\end{solution}", ""]}